Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 20:56:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ProseDraw 0.1-2 and ProseWriter 0.1-4: the layout fix

Both applications' client areas drew over their own scroll bars and
panels after a resize (a user report): ProseDraw's scroll view followed
the window while its panels did not, and it had no FrameResized, so the
constructor's layout was the only one there ever was; ProseWriter sized
its scroll view one pixel past its content box on both axes. Repackaged
from the commit that fixes them (main d069f85).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Prose-Patch: 0090-prosedraw-0-1-2-and-prosewriter-0-1-4-the-layout-fix.patch d20fb32917effe9b4179845e97bd738c275ea3be99b21f635b8e1ac34d22e213
